# ============================================================
# CornUi Project Rules
# Cline AI Development Context
# ============================================================


# PROJECT IDENTITY

Project Name:
CornUi

Type:
Roblox Luau UI Library

Current Version:
2.0.0

Previous Stable Version:
1.9.3

Developer:
Ohiocteator22

Purpose:
A modular, mobile-first Roblox UI framework designed for
loadstring execution, exploit environments, and normal Roblox
ModuleScript usage.

CornUi is inspired by:
- Orion UI
- Fluent UI
- Modern Roblox UI libraries

However, CornUi is its own independent framework.


# ============================================================
# CORE ARCHITECTURE
# ============================================================


Main source directory:

Source/


Structure:


Source/
│
├── init.lua
│
├── Core/
│   │
│   ├── Library.lua
│   ├── Config.lua
│   ├── ThemeManager.lua
│   ├── Services.lua
│   ├── Utils.lua
│   ├── State.lua
│   └── Signal.lua
│
│
├── Window/
│   │
│   ├── Window.lua
│   ├── Tabs.lua
│   └── Methods.lua
│
│
└── Widgets/
    │
    ├── init.lua
    │
    ├── Button.lua
    ├── Toggle.lua
    ├── Slider.lua
    ├── Dropdown.lua
    ├── ColorPicker.lua
    ├── Keybind.lua
    ├── Label.lua
    ├── Section.lua
    ├── Divider.lua
    ├── Paragraph.lua
    ├── Image.lua
    ├── ProgressBar.lua
    └── Notification.lua



# ============================================================
# LOADING SYSTEM
# ============================================================


CornUi supports loadstring execution.

Example:

```lua
local CornUi = loadstring(
    game:HttpGet(
        "URL"
    )
)()
